flowchart LR
  client[북웨이브 앱]
  app[bookwave-app\n주문 API]
  chatbot[bookwave-chatbot\nDMZ]
  cover[bookwave-cover-upload\nDMZ 별도 컨테이너]
  pg[mock-pg\nOD-02-X 경계]
  card[haeon-card\n정상 승인 코어]
  bwdb[(bookwave-mysql)]
  carddb[(haeon-card-mysql)]
  evidence[(evidence\n읽기 중심)]
  merchant[가맹점 담당자]
  gateway[haeon-lab-gateway\n로컬 포털]
  support[haeon-merchant-support\n진단·탐지·대응]
  receiver[haeon-lab-receiver\n내부 수신기]

  subgraph FRONT[front_net]
    client --> app
  end

  subgraph DMZ[dmz_net]
    app --> chatbot
    chatbot --> cover
    app --> pg
    chatbot --> bwdb
  end

  subgraph CARD[card_net]
    pg --> card
    card --> carddb
  end

  subgraph HAEON_LAB[haeon_lab_net · 내부 진단망]
    gateway --> support
    support --> receiver
  end
  merchant --> gateway

  app -. 주문·결제 로그 .-> evidence
  pg -. PG 원문·검증 결과 .-> evidence
  card -. 승인·감사 증거 .-> evidence

